You asked for it. We built it. The **Beat22 SoundKits Marketplace (Kits22)** is now LIVE — enabling producers, musicians, and artists to **buy, sell, and monetize sound kits globally** using a simple **credit-based system**. This guide explains:

-   How the credit system works
-   How subscribed sellers get **Kits22 FREE via credits**
-   How Basic sellers and buyers can access Kits22
-   How credits help you upgrade your beat quality

**What is Kits22?** Kits22 is Beat22’s dedicated **SoundKits Marketplace**, where:

-   Producers, instrumentalists, and session musicians sell original sound kits
-   Music producers, DJs, and artists buy high-quality sounds
-   Transactions are powered by **credits**, not cash per kit

This makes buying sound kits **simpler, faster, and more flexible**. **Who Gets Kits22 Credits? Subscribed Sellers (FREE Credits)** If you are a **subscribed seller**, you automatically receive Kits22 credits as part of your plan — **no extra payment required**. **Basic Sellers & Buyers**

-   Do **not** receive credits, they have to purchase

**Subscribing is the smartest way to unlock Kits22.**

![Subscribing is the smartest way to unlock Kits22.](/images/2025/12/Screenshot-2025-12-19-140640.png)

**Credit Allocation by Subscription Plan**

| **Plan** | **Price** | **Monthly / Total Credits** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Pro Monthly** | ₹599 / month | **100 credits every month** |
| **Premium Annual** | ₹3,999 / year | **600 credits total** |
| **Pro Annual** | ₹5,999 / year | **1,250 credits total** |

These credits can be used to buy **any Kits22 sound kit**.

![These credits can be used to buy any Kits22 sound kit.](/images/2025/12/Screenshot-2025-12-19-140926.png)

**Example: How Credits Work in Real Life Pro Monthly Seller Example**

-   Pro Monthly cost: **₹599/ month**
-   Credits received: **100 credits/month**

**Scenario 1:**

-   Buy a 75-credit sound kit
-   Remaining balance: **25 credits**
-   Use 25 credits to buy another kit OR save them

**Scenario 2 (Smart Pooling):**

-   Use no credits this month
-   Next month you will receive **+100 credits**
-   Total credits = 125
-   Buy a premium credit kit and still have credits left

Credits can be **pooled**, giving you flexibility to invest in **higher-quality sound kits**. **Why This Matters for Producers** Sound kits directly impact:

-   Beat quality
-   Creativity
-   Production speed
-   Industry competitiveness

With Kits22:

-   You upgrade your sound without extra spending
-   You get access to **professionally curated kits**
-   You stay ahead of the market

**Better sounds = better beats = better sales. Why You Should Subscribe Now** ✔ Get Kits22 credits FREE ✔ Access premium sound kits ✔ Improve beat quality instantly ✔ Monetize your own sound kits ✔ First-mover advantage in the marketplace Subscriptions aren’t just plans - they are **tools to level up your production game**. [Click here](/2025/06/30/how-do-i-upgrade-my-account-on-beat22/) to know which plan is best for you. **Final Word** You asked for a **SoundKits marketplace. We delivered.** Now it’s your turn. [Subscribe](https://beat22.com/subscriptions), explore [Kits22](https://beat22.com/soundskits), use your credits wisely, and **make the most of the sounds you’ve always needed**. Let’s take this to the next level. Let’s build the sound revolution together.
